  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ほぼ　うごかないが　いきている。\nのまずくわずで　からに　こもるうち\nちょうのうりょくに　めざめたらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "거의 움직이지 않지만 살아 있다.\n식음을 전폐하고 껍질에 은둔하는 동안\n초능력에 눈을 뜬 모양이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "雖然幾乎從來不動但還是活著的。\n牠的超能力似乎是在縮在殼裡\n不吃不喝的過程中覺醒的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ne bouge presque pas, mais il est bien vivant.\nOn dit qu’il aurait découvert ses pouvoirs\npsychiques à force de jeûner dans sa coquille.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Obwohl es sich fast nie bewegt, ist es am Leben.\nEs sollen Psycho-Kräfte in ihm erwacht sein, als\nes ohne Nahrung in seinem Panzer ausharrte.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Apenas se mueve, pero está vivo. Se cree que\nadquiere poderes psíquicos mientras permanece\nrecluido en su caparazón sin comer ni beber.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si muove appena, ma è vivo. Sembra che sviluppi\npoteri paranormali mentre se ne sta rintanato nel\nsuo guscio senza bere né mangiare.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It barely moves, but it’s still alive. Hiding in its\nshell without food or water seems to have\nawakened its psychic powers.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ほぼ　動かないが　生きている。\n飲まず食わずで　殻に　こもるうち\n超能力に　目覚めたらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "虽然几乎从来不动但还是活着的。\n它的超能力似乎是在缩在壳里\n不吃不喝的过程中觉醒的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Apenas se mueve, pero está vivo. Se cree que\nadquiere poderes psíquicos mientras permanece\nrecluido en su caparazón sin comer ni beber.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "からの　なかで　せいちょうちゅう。\nサイコパワーで　そとの　ようすを\nうかがい　しんかに　そなえている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "껍질 안에서 성장 중이다.\n사이코 파워로 밖의 상태를\n살피며 진화에 대비하고 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "正在殼裡成長著。\n用精神力量掌握外界的\n狀況，做好進化的準備。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se développe dans sa coquille et se prépare\nà évoluer en sondant les alentours grâce\nà ses pouvoirs psychiques.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Im Inneren seines Panzers wächst es. Während es\nsich auf die Entwicklung vorbereitet, prüft es mit\nseinen Psycho-Kräften, was im Freien geschieht.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Está en constante crecimiento dentro del\ncaparazón. Mientras se prepara para evolucionar,\nexamina el exterior con sus poderes psíquicos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Continua a crescere dentro il suo guscio.\nIn attesa dell’evoluzione, percepisce il mondo\nesterno grazie ai suoi poteri psichici.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "As it grows inside its shell, it uses its psychic\nabilities to monitor the outside world and\nprepare for evolution.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "殻の　中で　成長中。\nサイコパワーで　外の　様子を\nうかがい　進化に　備えている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "正在壳里成长着。\n用精神力量掌握外界的\n状况，做好进化的准备。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Está en constante crecimiento dentro del\ncaparazón. Mientras se prepara para evolucionar,\nexamina el exterior con sus poderes psíquicos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
